{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>The שָׁלָךְ.</b> Our Sages explained: this is the bird that draws fish up from the sea — and this is how Onkelos rendered it: וְשָׁלֵי נוּנָא (Ḥullin 63)." "<b>The כּוֹס and the יַנְשׁוּף.</b> They are צואי״טש — the ones that cry out at night, and they have teeth like a person; and there is another similar to it that they call יי״בו."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:50.552663218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}